@Anna Yeddi I am trying to test this rn.. and can't seem to locate to the specific highlight.. am I delulu.. or is it not working? 

To test it go to about:config and turn on: dom.text_fragments.create_text_fragment.enabled

then select some text, select "copy link to highlight" from menu... then paste that somewhere and listen to the experience.

